  "title": "Amish Custard Cottage Cheese Pie",
  "description": "A hint of lemon and lots of cottage cheese add a delightful twist to this easy-to-make, light custard pie. Use a graham cracker crust or a pastry crust.",
  "authors": [
    "MARBALET"
  ],
